<title>USA: Miami judge grants UPS Teamster injunction.</title>
<headline>Miami judge grants UPS Teamster injunction.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>A judge in Miami grated United Parcel service an injunction Friday barring the Teamster's union from interfering in the company's operations.</p>
<p>The injunction from Dade County Ronald Friedman against Teamsters Local Union No. 769 applies only in Dade County, which encompasses the urban Miami area, court spokesman Mort Lucoff said.</p>
</text>
